OL,3,GNEWSAMachete-wielding robbers hold up
OL,4,Acash delivery van
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "distinctive" van is being hunted
OL,7,Fafter a cash delivery driver was robbed
OL,8,Fby two men armed with a machete.
OL,10,FWest Midlands Police said it happened
OL,11,Fat the Windmills Shopping Park in Cape
OL,12,FHill, Smethwick, at about 07:45 GMT on
OL,13,FMonday.
OL,15,FThe victim, who was not hurt during the
OL,16,Fincident, was robbed by two men wearing
OL,17,Fbalaclavas who fled with a "quantity of
OL,18,Fcash," a force spokesperson said.
